# Explicit ignore — needed for --archive=tgz mode (auto-exclusion bypassed).
# See web/.vercelignore's 2026-08-01 note: without this, node_modules/.next
# get walked in full during archive packing, which can hang or crash on a
# large dev-generated .next (72k+ files observed elsewhere in this repo).
node_modules
.next
.vercel
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
README.md
*.md
scripts/__pycache__/

# 2026-08-01: Root Directory="thaifacialclinic-portable" means --archive=tgz
# still walks from repo root (same "web/web" gotcha as web/'s project).
# Mirror web/.vercelignore's sibling-folder exclusions to avoid the same
# race-condition crashes against other live projects' churning files.
run
web-factory
web-thaigle
web-restaurants
web-dental
web-golf
web-petbkk
2nd
3rd
chillanel
dbd-scraper
cosmetics
siamverified-portable
wiki_generator
wongnai
nordvpn
node-openvpn-socks
bangkok_clinics
bangkok_reviews
logs
web
